          "content_sha256": "4c7efa8e182fd725ae17f59ed7b7c57f5a78536bc39c1a1ce95d5f2cb93e27dc",
          "excerpt": "Another China-based defense and military-industrial researcher used Claude to develop about 16 software modules for electronic warfare and suppression of enemy air defenses.",
